	(text_box "TODO:\nBased on what I gathered, the most efficient way to do this would be:\n3V3: VBUS -> battery charger -> Switch -> MOSFET -> VSYS -> pico -> 3V3,\n5V: bat -> switch -> MOSFET -> BOOST -> MOSFET w/ VBUS -> 5V, not going through pico"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
