	)
	(text_box "(fast charging)    6000mAh * 0.5C = 3000mA\n(regular charging) 6000mAh * 0.2C = 1200mA\nMAX: 1400/1.2 = 1166.66 Ohms\nHTP4056 can only do 1.2A max"
